---
import WikiLayout from "../layouts/WikiLayout.astro";
---
<WikiLayout title="Archive | Underlords Wiki" description="Behind-the-scenes source and provenance layer for the Underlords Wiki.">
  <section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">BEHIND THE SCENES</div><h1>Archive</h1><p class="tagline">This is where the production notes live: receipts, transcript sources, provenance, uncertainty, identity joins, and the things the main wiki pages should not have to explain mid-scene.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section detail-layout">
    <article class="detail-main">
      <h2>Research source</h2><p>The existing <code>bossmugen/underlords</code> repository remains the research vault and canonical source layer. This wiki is a separate presentation project built from that evidence, not a fork of the old site's page architecture.</p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:4rem">Evidence rules</h2>
      <div class="index-list">
        <div class="index-card"><small>ARCHIVE-CONFIRMED</small><h3>Receipts exist</h3><p>Transcript, media, stable ID, or other primary archive evidence supports the claim.</p></div>
        <div class="index-card"><small>MUGS-CONFIRMED</small><h3>Owner correction</h3><p>Direct project-owner canon outranks prior assistant synthesis.</p></div>
        <div class="index-card"><small>INFERRED</small><h3>Interpretation</h3><p>Useful synthesis, clearly separated from a literal source claim.</p></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <aside class="infobox"><div class="infobox-title">Credit grammar</div><dl><div class="row"><dt>SAID BY</dt><dd>who said the words</dd></div><div class="row"><dt>POSTED BY</dt><dd>who uploaded / posted the object</dd></div><div class="row"><dt>MADE BY</dt><dd>creator credit</dd></div><div class="row"><dt>CAPTURED BY</dt><dd>who took the screenshot/photo</dd></div><div class="row"><dt>FEATURING</dt><dd>who appears in it</dd></div></dl></aside>
  </section>
</WikiLayout>
